  "Kingdom of Bunyoro": {capital:"Shifting royal enclosures; Masindi under Kabalega; later Hoima",founder:"Isingoma Mpuga Rukidi (traditionally)",predecessor:"Empire of Kitara",successor:"Uganda Protectorate"},
  "Merina Kingdom": {capital:"Antananarivo; Ambohimanga under Andrianampoinimerina before c. 1794",founder:"Andriamanelo (traditionally); reunified by Andrianampoinimerina",successor:"French Madagascar"},
